Map<String, String> results = hashingService.hashStrings(Arrays.asList("hello", "world"));
System.out.println(results);
```

This service supports dynamic logging configuration through `setLoggingEnabled()` and `setLogLevel()` methods. You can use these to disable or change the level of detail in your logs, without needing to restart your application. Note that this is just a basic implementation, you may need to adapt it according to your specific needs and constraints.
']

